        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The announcement and application procedures contained in Section B above shall also not be applicable to the positions of bus operator and bus attendants. These positions will be filled from a list of applicants who have completed successfully the approved training program, subject to the prior observance of the procedures stated in Article 37 (Transportation), Section H.1.",
